service.description:
An open request for quote's name, description, wanted date, customer and contact, and its assignment (design
            §5 QuoteRequestDetail's Assign): the owner one who works for the organization (the caller or, unless SALES_TEAM_MANAGE, a
            member of a team of theirs; OWNER_INVALID), the team a current team of it (one of theirs unless SALES_TEAM_MANAGE;
            TEAM_UNAVAILABLE), the customer an account of it or a shared one (CUSTOMER_INVALID) and the contact one of its contacts
            (CONTACT_INVALID); the replaced party row ended, never deleted. Needs SALES_QUOTE_EDIT on a request the caller sees;
            refuses a closed request (REQUEST_CLOSED) and a stale revision (REVISION_CHANGED).

A published or scheduled template ended now or at a later date (no quote starts from it after that), or a
            draft set aside unpublished. Needs a template manager (PERMISSION_DENIED) on a template they see (RECORD_UNAVAILABLE);
            refuses a stale revision (REVISION_CHANGED) and one ended already (TEMPLATE_ENDED).
